{"time": 1767960509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "833449889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之次日早上"}
{"time": 1767960572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211683542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾放下汉斯看过一遍的报纸，看了看不知道在干什么的你们“明天就开学了，今天是不是该先搬行李进宿舍了？”"}
{"time": 1767960764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128108208", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"行李已经收过一些，倒也没必要带太多，回房间拎出来放在门口，\"我准备好啦。\""}
{"time": 1767960891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1862488389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“想想好要带什么吧。衣服，钱，你的玩偶……学校里用外面的钱吗？”"}
{"time": 1767961020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145683220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己行李倒是基本没有什么，把衣服之类的收拾收拾，钱和徽章带好“我也好啦”"}
{"time": 1767961057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1426264903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好没生活（））"}
{"time": 1767961069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187261242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"带一点衣服，嗯...再带一点钱?\"点着东西，\"也没必要一次带太多啦，周末还要回来，平常也可以收一些过去。啊...\"稍做思考，把最中意的小熊人偶装进行李。"}
{"time": 1767961070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128894333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（怎么没生活了）"}
{"time": 1767961121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102591512", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就是好没生活啊（））"}
{"time": 1767961139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "58854182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然确实没什么娱乐项目）"}
{"time": 1767961155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375892964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是有一种在宿舍除了睡觉只能发呆的感觉）"}
{"time": 1767961188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199356422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但这个世界甚至有售货机）"}
{"time": 1767961204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465371668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（科技水平很难评价）"}
{"time": 1767961338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649034510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"差不多...\"封好包拎起来，\"书就不带了嘛，图书馆应该会有，想看的我我去那边找就好了。\""}
{"time": 1767961380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "326986027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还行，东西不多”舒蕾拍了拍手，站起来“还差什么都还来得及再跑。要我帮忙吗？”"}
{"time": 1767961411, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510916852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "想了想感觉好像不缺什么了"}
{"time": 1767961477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1349030813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（用着用着就会发现缺了）"}
{"time": 1767961483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318410357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（肥皂衣架什么的）"}
{"time": 1767961515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505166174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那还真是）"}
{"time": 1767961524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "14732435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我是不是还缺被子啊（）"}
{"time": 1767961530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40709362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（床垫）"}
{"time": 1767961581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "819121164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你又不是没上过学（））"}
{"time": 1767961583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "973006189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘿嘿...妈妈当然要一起去学校啦。\"拎着东西，\"不过就不用妈妈拎了。\""}
{"time": 1767961642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224227260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...床上用品是不是得再去买一套”看看发的文件有没有说宿舍床的尺寸"}
{"time": 1767961710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494223445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "就当买过了"}
{"time": 1767961742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391086335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过我觉得厚棕芯床垫应该是没有的）"}
{"time": 1767961762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573867801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“生活用品之类的，学校内应该也有卖吧....”"}
{"time": 1767961841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832429218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "如果这几天你们又进过学校考察过的话"}
{"time": 1767961848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "471371304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那就会知道是卖的"}
{"time": 1767961891, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177753267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(应该有卖吧)"}
{"time": 1767961919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "752924182", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"学校里应该有?先进去看看咯，今天说不定还能碰到室友。\""}
{"time": 1767961976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632236714", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那出发吧”背好行李准备出门"}
{"time": 1767962148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441977647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（gt）"}
{"time": 1767962188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165808193", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾真的没有帮你们提行李，去学院的路已经不陌生，总觉得走起来也比前几日快些"}
{"time": 1767962273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565913081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看自己分配的宿舍，脚步轻快，迫不及待想看看自己的室友。"}
{"time": 1767962460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827659423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不多时，已经到了校门口。与先前不同，今天是休息日，也不是午休时段。校园内热闹不少。有人在自己的鞋底附上冰晶，在平坦的广场上滑出利落的轨迹；有人靠着自己的召唤兽在草坪上享受早冬的日光浴。等入学仪式举行过后，禁空就会解除，到时候连天上都会铺满青春气息"}
{"time": 1767962680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869246696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "说起来，自己之前鲜少和这么多同龄人...?在一起，未白虽然也有小伙伴，不过...摇摇头不去想这件事，徽章别在衣服上，应该可以直接过去。"}
{"time": 1767962743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125740800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你想起来自己不需要徽章也可以直接过去。但是想要打开通道则需要魔力激活"}
{"time": 1767962920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1831142955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "自己也不想弄得太显眼，打开通道带着母亲进去，看一眼地图，朝自己的宿舍走，\"待会来找我咯，伊恩。\""}
