{"time": 1768012910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553824735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1768013101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975167184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来开门的是靠门床位的主人。房间里的另一人看起来远没有前者那么矜持，随性地坐在上床床沿，身形高挑，不着鞋袜的欣长小腿在半空晃啊晃，好奇的目光从稍高一些的地方投下。头发同样是栗色，但和下面那位气质完全不同"}
{"time": 1768013118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140578442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（另一位就大夏老师吧那就）"}
{"time": 1768013229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956946196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "整个人显得有些弱气，总觉得没什么底气，\"我叫舒茉...也是入学的新生...\""}
{"time": 1768013618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "453532922", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=414262402]倒是远些那位先开了口“这里是503~是新舍友吗？是新舍友吧，你是第三名哦。我叫莫奈，是第二名。”随后她指了指给你开门的那个女生“她是第一名。”\n开门的女生没理会论资排辈般的介绍，小幅地对你点点头“greeting，我叫梅琳娜。都是新生。”随后又对舒蕾点点头“阿姨好”"}
{"time": 1768013631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672490950", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=928888800]（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1768013703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "467203532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥舍友怎么选比较好呢）"}
{"time": 1768013765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882088336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（来个最有强度的那维莱特？）"}
{"time": 1768013776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113773916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那很有强度了)"}
{"time": 1768013902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1460145693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=453532922]\"莫奈...梅琳娜...\"轻轻点头，语气同样很轻，\"舒茉记住了...嗯...\"有些不知道怎么开口，话题...得创造话题才行...开口却成了\"我不太懂魔法...\""}
{"time": 1768013952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118577687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（轻而易举地就丢出了我接不明白的话题）"}
