{"time": 1768021131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507478833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;害羞&#93;,file=74-741058d3531840cd833c03aa235136b4.gif,url=https://gxh.vip.qq.com/club/item/parcel/item/74/741058d3531840cd833c03aa235136b4/raw300.gif,key=724f54b2b3f38c90,emoji_id=741058d3531840cd833c03aa235136b4,emoji_package_id=205004]"}
{"time": 1768021324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361331360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=287641322]你推门，看见一个穿着熨帖马甲的笔挺男人站在对面的阳台窗前，面朝窗外看着什么。即便考虑社交需求，他这一身在宿舍里也太过正式。他听到有人推门，头也不回，先把手朝右边伸出，打了个响指。右边的椅子上坐着的金发男子干脆地掏出几枚银币放在他伸出的手中“算你厉害”"}
{"time": 1768021350, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418023551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1768021388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024844043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（以及伊神还没选床位）"}
{"time": 1768021392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094573324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那个，你们好，我叫伊恩...两位怎么称呼”"}
{"time": 1768021394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "11736876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(选了)"}
{"time": 1768021400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406656724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=587270418]()"}
{"time": 1768021429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578808497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦（）"}
{"time": 1768021639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404264212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=587270418]两人一时有点不知道该不该说“可以”，片刻之后莫奈把腿收回床沿内“我没意见……诶，这个问题不用问的吧？”"}
{"time": 1768021866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17430532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1404264212]\"...不用问吗？...诶...这样吗...\"缓缓摇着脑袋，\"不对不对...还是要问的吧...\"感觉自己身上冒着傻气，埋下脑袋。"}
{"time": 1768021982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504544958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1094573324]“Sherlock.”靠窗的男生转了过来，报上了自己的名字。和你比起来他白上一些，脸上带着成功人士般的微笑。“我刚刚和他打赌，下一个人什么时候会到，看来是我赢了。”\n“打赌之前你没说你还会占卜，不过我不会指控作弊的”坐在一旁的男人输了也不闹，转过头来看你，“你好，我叫柯林斯，主修火与风属性。”"}
{"time": 1768022043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1880548198", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（怎么不叫迈德摩斯）"}
{"time": 1768022281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "535974949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=17430532]“要、要的吗？我没问诶”反倒是莫奈看起来有些手足无措。如她所言，她是第二个来的，下意识看向梅琳娜。梅琳娜摇摇头，依旧惜字如金，“请便。”"}
{"time": 1768022608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1762453301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=535974949]“啊...我的问题...”意识到自己把话题聊得有点死，急于开口但窘迫之下又有些不知道从何说起，脸红得厉害，“对不起...”"}
{"time": 1768023765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748021982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "更大的问题是两人都不知道该不该和你说没关系。场面一度十分沉默，直到莫奈从床上爬下来，光脚踩在冰凉的地板上“那个，要帮忙吗？”"}
{"time": 1768023897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025282736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1504544958]（怎么还是英文名（）"}
{"time": 1768024002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747895420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（下次叫经营顾问）"}
{"time": 1768024104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1490041810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=748021982]“嗯...”抬起头，有些如释重负的感觉，尽管感觉脸颊还是烫烫地，“莫奈同学...谢谢...”"}
{"time": 1768024109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443811448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们好啊”再次打招呼 然后确认一下床上有没有写名字，没有的话就随便挑个空床位"}
{"time": 1768024858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377165486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1490041810]（so？）"}
{"time": 1768024915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822599980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=443811448]自然没有。先到的两人都挑了靠阳台的床位"}
{"time": 1768024950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198968856", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看一眼妈妈，感觉自己的表现有一点丢脸，咬着唇，弯腰拆开行李，取出自己的东西放在桌上，“麻烦莫奈同学帮我铺一下床...”"}
{"time": 1768024988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "244557925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就面向阳台左手边靠门的床位，把行李放在那里，然后开始收拾“对了，两位都是哪里人呢”找个话题聊聊天"}
