{"time": 1768187580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160367458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=781787997]收拾好被子，满意地打量打量收拾完全的床铺，探出脑袋，\"好了，妈妈看看怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1768187726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507436613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”她很随意地抬头看了看“还不错吧？”不知道为什么她反而是发问的语气"}
{"time": 1768187747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506590807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=740968027][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “我也是刚到啦”然后继续去收拾"}
{"time": 1768188020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968428251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=507436613]目光有些谨慎地转到莫奈...紧接着是梅琳娜那边，然后快速收回来，自己在想什么...?甩甩头，从床上下来"}
{"time": 1768188412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105309723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好变态，最近抗吧全是在地域黑广东人）"}
{"time": 1768188644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2085097982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=506590807]“肯特郡……”夏洛克依旧看不懂空气地自顾自做着推理“中低产家庭……不过放心，这里没有阶级歧视。也允许养宠物，对吧。”他扭头看向你这边"}
{"time": 1768188799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122016477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“宠物？”有点摸不着头脑"}
{"time": 1768188903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1292159567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=968428251]（then？）"}
{"time": 1768188986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1058543876", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1122016477]“他裤腿处的抓痕明显来自没剪干净直架的猫。我和柯林斯都不介意宿舍里多一只安静的宠物。你呢？”"}
{"time": 1768188995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187412072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1122016477] “他裤腿处的抓痕明显来自没剪干净指甲的猫。我和柯林斯都不介意宿舍里多一只安静的宠物。你呢？”"}
{"time": 1768189063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769595550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头，“我也无所谓了”不过柯林斯都没说话夏洛克怎么知道他无所谓的"}
{"time": 1768189066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801119586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=968428251]\"不知道还会不会有新同学来...\"站在自己的桌边，刚刚听着母亲谈话，下定决心鼓起勇气抛开话题"}
{"time": 1768189077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657196472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=769595550]（有没有可能昨天聊过了）"}
{"time": 1768189397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188737996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1801119586]“不知道诶，如果有的话，希望是个一样好看的妹妹，这样我们就可以竞争一下最美新生寝室咯？说起来你的蓝头发好漂亮，和漫画里的一样，是在哪里染的？”"}
{"time": 1768189623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454603888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=188737996]\"染...?\"困惑地眨眨眼睛，不过有人接过话的感觉很好，\"这个是天生的啦...看起来很像染的吗？嗯...最美新生寝室有梅琳娜和莫奈就够了啦...\""}
{"time": 1768189647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832198886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=769595550]“喔，夏洛克同学去过我们那边吗？怎么看出来的？”亚克看起来也有些惊讶于这个怪人“那……下次回家的时候我把怀斯抱过来，他可聪明了，小虫子小老鼠都跑不掉”"}
{"time": 1768189776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771251892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我想起来一个地狱笑话）"}
