{"time": 1768211129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1651991503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=194801966][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “哎？下午我们不一起逛逛吗”"}
{"time": 1768211220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491641996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"毕竟还要送蛋糕回去嘛。\"蛋糕还剩一点，暂时没动，\"晚上应该...室友会在一起吃饭?\"抬起头，一只手捧着脸。"}
{"time": 1768211288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156254455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，也对吧...”但是自己跟室友说晚上才回去，算了算了，自己顶多被嘲笑一下吧"}
{"time": 1768211506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705349837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "手里把玩着勺子，\"伊恩?\"轻声唤他，\"怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1768211592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961746968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没什么啦”摇摇头“那我们下次什么时候再见面”"}
