{"time": 1768242342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140924419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=278224860][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “嗯，拜拜”转身，不过免不了有些失落就是了，下来就去小摊逛逛吧"}
{"time": 1768242441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27162207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"拜拜～\"提着蛋糕上楼"}
{"time": 1768242790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335271367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2140924419]你们先前就已经在广场上经过过来，比你大几岁的学长学姐们支着简单的小摊。有些擅长木石造物的学生的摊位自然看起来高级一些。卖的东西当然也不止书本。晶石、药水、魔杖甚至魔宠都能见得着"}
{"time": 1768243185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1389997570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去找找柯林斯同款手册"}
{"time": 1768243202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "912426598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=27162207]你的寝室里传出美妙的肉香味.jpg"}
{"time": 1768243249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "653239217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"本来没怎么吃饱，这下更有了些食欲，敲敲门"}
{"time": 1768243335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1364028159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1389997570]当然不难找。卖它的人把它说得天花乱坠，什么“学园生存手册”、“一本在手四年无忧”之类的形容一个接一个。不过看起来确实卖得紧俏。一本10银，价格相当微妙，但是感觉也很难赚到什么。"}
{"time": 1768243431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363737556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽说舒茉说给她带一本，但买一本自己看完再给她不就行了，不是很厚的样子“学长，来一本吧”递出10枚银币"}
{"time": 1768243476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376762990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=653239217]（咦，难道你开不了门吗）"}
{"time": 1768243606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1977915542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以开，但是敲门很礼貌)"}
{"time": 1768243636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1488170080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=653239217]\"我回来了。\"敲完门开口，随后再打开门进去"}
{"time": 1768243719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705875473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=363737556]“好嘞，10银买不了吃亏买不了上当。学弟是扩招进来的吧，什么专业？”那人收过钱，说了一连串轱辘话“这儿什么专业的都有用得上的，再看看？”"}
{"time": 1768243760, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333585387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯对的，学长我是元素科的”"}
{"time": 1768243972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348198501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1488170080]“呀，欢迎回来~”预想之中的第四位舍友暂未出现，梅琳娜靠在莫奈的桌边，金红的火焰加热着莫奈拿在手中的……锅，那正是油花和肉香的发源地“我们在做汉堡肉排，就快好了”"}
{"time": 1768244109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901233685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眨了眨眼，对眼前的一幕感觉有些新奇，身体也对香味有了些反应，咽了口口水，回头关上门，先把面包放在莫奈的桌上，\"闻起来好香诶～\""}
{"time": 1768244184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481478808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=333585387]（好的，我好像得咬打火机了）"}
{"time": 1768244186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743193395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（让我想想）"}
{"time": 1768244194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1880528342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你有什么想要的吗.jpg）"}
