{"time": 1768271987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489527915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是其实我根本没想好她为什么不吃，等我想想）"}
{"time": 1768272684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1610324490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她轻轻摇头，声音比动作还轻“不是，我只是觉得，本来就不多。”"}
{"time": 1768272822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307400634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...我刚刚在食堂吃过一点蛋糕，中午也算吃过了啦，梅琳娜替我尝尝，好吗？\"目光看向她，笑盈盈地。"}
{"time": 1768273026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635590826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦，好像）"}
