{"time": 1768280284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867962550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（格外和有些就不太能出现在一起）"}
{"time": 1768280290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1636327514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=558153003]\"嗯...\"自己也有些犯困，\"那我也睡一会好了，诶...下午会醒吗？\""}
{"time": 1768280339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "430608424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我没有午睡的习惯。”梅琳娜轻声开口，但是不难听清“到时间我会叫你们。”"}
{"time": 1768280461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712068948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯，麻烦梅琳娜了。\"上床窝进自己铺的被子里，安心睡下。"}
{"time": 1768282415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678636721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=F6D30E3B190F4E00CA14D0C3EE4B90AD.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQZ9vB1VTG95EIAKzOh5T4VK9r34RjMwAkg_woo_NWpqeWHkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQU757f1Sn_Qo33b7rYyAm5XoCeGOCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMO-VnlCWiXT6q21KJXo626IFQzR8qUswMAGTgOTah7Vl5CfHGquMNBzSu9H19rnVxA,file_size=155724]"}
