{"time": 1768287528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1426790275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(其实在看ocy坦克)"}
{"time": 1768288162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334262914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1703157696]\"嗯...\"揉了揉头发，从床上坐起来，等莫奈先下床，打个哈欠之后慢悠悠地下到地面，\"待会麻烦莫奈带路了。\""}
{"time": 1768288360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669303203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "莫奈刚醒就一副活力满满的样子，轻车熟路地铺开化妆包，对着镜子打扮起来“嗯，其实很显眼的”"}
{"time": 1768288479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274817810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "很快就打扮好了自己，其实看起来变化不大，但是细微调整过的线条和颜色看起来的确又让她看起来更可人了些。她招呼你坐到她旁边“舒茉，来吧，我先帮你弄”"}
{"time": 1768288555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503513148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"坐到她旁边，虽然头发刚睡醒有些凌乱，\"麻烦莫奈了..\""}
{"time": 1768288624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496506178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实我觉得木头有点像円香（））"}
{"time": 1768288722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1988847935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(就是很像吧)"}
{"time": 1768288791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528049435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她拿起软笔和粉扑在你脸上轻加工，弄得你有些痒。不过她手脚很快，从头到尾也就几分钟"}
{"time": 1768289059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1964842011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "最后她把镜子立在你面前，镜子里的你看起来眼睛看起来又大了些，脸上为数不多的瑕疵也被遮住，眼角更是带上极淡的惹人恋爱的玫红眼影。"}
{"time": 1768289168, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688283254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怜爱（））"}
{"time": 1768289189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064813057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"自己眨眨眼，镜子里的自己也眨了眨眼，\"这...\"尤其在意眼角的眼影，\"好漂亮...这是怎么做的?\""}
{"time": 1768289438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791653200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么说呢，你也可以当做是一种魔法……学起来比较麻烦就是啦。”她拍了拍你“好啦，下一个！梅琳娜酱”"}
