{"time": 1768303088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2067079350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“她确实很漂亮”有些自豪的说到，边说边朝着学生会的方向走"}
{"time": 1768303126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929081824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1642457599]“嗯……现在也可以嘛。好不容易出来，这么快就分开可不好。我的那些社团什么时候去都行的嘛。”莫奈踮起脚尖找着招牌"}
{"time": 1768303305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983661490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1929081824]\"诶...\"既然莫奈这么说，自己作为提出话题的人当然不会有意见，点点头，\"嗯，现在就去吧!也许我们也可以...参加学生会...\"眨眼，\"可以吗？\""}
{"time": 1768303410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356243598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（到时候梅琳娜因为有纹身被刷下来了（不是））"}
{"time": 1768303454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1799168564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(政审不通过?)"}
{"time": 1768303689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871199170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2067079350]“真羡慕你……我这样的可能这辈子都没机会结交这么漂亮的女生吧”任谁都能听出他语气中的不自信，不过很快就调整过来“去学生会那边看看吧，不知道柯林斯还在不在”"}
{"time": 1768303936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112583573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1983661490] “不知道有没有什么要求，不过你是主任钦点入学的学生诶，想进肯定可以的吧？哦，在那边……”她确认了方向，带着你往那边走"}
{"time": 1768304019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306194118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1871199170][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “自信一点啦，亚克长得也蛮帅的么”拍拍他的肩"}
{"time": 1768304021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "347051163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"学生会的学长学姐也不会知道这种事吧...\"颇有些不自信，\"莫奈倒是很适合啦，学生会不会欢迎我这种...开不了口的学生的...\"跟着莫奈的脚步"}
{"time": 1768304060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757878975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像没给过亚克的立绘。不如说其实没给过几个立绘）"}
{"time": 1768304320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229441352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1306194118]说起来连他也比你高一点点，拍上去的时候感觉肌肉也比较结实，只是本人面部线条确实没什么特色，看起来也不够阳光“我还是有自知之明的”"}
{"time": 1768304352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683043150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不会黑化吧，一切都是亚克的旨意（）"}
{"time": 1768304365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593978454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（谁知道呢）"}
{"time": 1768304563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "652430849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=347051163]“咦呀，我没有那种兴趣啦，帮人跑腿筹备忙这忙那的”她吐了吐舌头“很麻烦诶。舒茉为什么会想进去？”"}
{"time": 1768304633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1164403076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了好了，我们先去找柯林斯吧”"}
{"time": 1768304665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048101074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“自信一点，都会好起来的”"}
{"time": 1768304687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "319668843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=652430849]\"倒也没有啦...不过觉得要是能进去的话...嗯...会不会...\"摇摇头，\"能证明自己一些。\"深呼吸"}
{"time": 1768304698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1875442157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你要帮他找女朋友吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1768304711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066522168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，说话的当口"}
{"time": 1768304716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1366422839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "又见面了.jpg"}
{"time": 1768304755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864839406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "梅琳娜站在学生会的宣传摊位前，而柯林斯，已经站到里面去了"}
{"time": 1768305088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069044665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"朝着伊恩点点头，跟着莫奈走到梅琳娜身边，\"梅琳娜?\"轻声唤她"}
{"time": 1768305136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769424464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1069044665][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 也朝舒茉点点头，然后绕个弯看看柯林斯忙不忙"}
{"time": 1768305152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855403262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "摊位里站着几个学生，和一位你们多少有些眼熟的前辈。学生们大多身着黑色款的校服，看起来应该是负责招新的老成员。桌案上摆着几本宣传册，内容大抵是历届学生会负责活动，还有优秀毕业代表云云。至于那位前辈，正是阿尼亚"}
{"time": 1768305254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980989997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"一时有些没反应过来，看向阿尼亚的目光有些呆愣愣的。"}
{"time": 1768305291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34046458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“阿尼亚学姐，下午好啊”给她打个招呼"}
{"time": 1768305309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96500787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "身为助教，出现在学生会的招募现场，当然不奇怪了.jpg"}
{"time": 1768305409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1174190317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "也跟着打个招呼，\"下午好。\""}
{"time": 1768305438, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919768025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1069044665]“你们来了？”她只是简单应着，低头专心填写着一张问卷。除了基础信息外还包括一些行为测试，甚至还有主观题。"}
{"time": 1768305457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29766102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（问卷带魔法灵光）"}
{"time": 1768305474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1597019061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我来这边找室友”走到柯林斯旁边"}
{"time": 1768305508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2112825942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1174190317]“嗯嗯，下午好。”这次她戴着眼镜，看起来多少封印了一些跳脱的成分"}
{"time": 1768305527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349852109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在忙吗”问一下他"}
{"time": 1768305849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190108463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "柯林斯点头，从后面跨了几步出来，提前拦住了你“伊恩，这边是后台。学生会成员才可以进入。”他指了指自己被加上了一层铜壳的校徽“学长学姐们说可以旁观学习，还没事给我干”"}
{"time": 1768305937, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198176565", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1919768025]低头看一看问卷，随后抬头询问阿尼亚，\"我也可以填吗?\""}
{"time": 1768306126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1688578285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh，这样.. ”自觉退出去"}
{"time": 1768306166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392395725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等会结束了，我们四个一起去吃个饭吧，和亚克还有夏洛特”"}
{"time": 1768306214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435366160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1198176565] “嗯，当然。只要你有心为同学们做事，有心提升自己，想结交更多朋友，就欢迎加入学生会。”阿尼亚点头，而莫奈看着似乎坐过去之后表情就会自然随时间变得僵硬寡淡的招牌，还是摇了摇头，自觉后退了两步"}
{"time": 1768306354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025054081", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=392395725]“当然没问题”他给你们比了个“ok”的手势"}
{"time": 1768306382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "839428685", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...莫奈，可以等我一下吗？\"摇摇牵着的手，另一只手拿起一张表"}
{"time": 1768306457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341413640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=839428685]“嗯嗯，你们两个都在这里，难道我还能走了不成？”"}
{"time": 1768306501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29499034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "阿尼亚适时补充到“违心的想法是写不到这张纸上的哦。”"}
{"time": 1768306548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1334504635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“行，那我就先不打扰你工作了”回到亚克和夏洛克那里“怎么说，你们俩对学生会感兴趣吗”"}
{"time": 1768306583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388823440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我为了舒茉加入学生会，是不是就填不上去）"}
