{"time": 1768308965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575808752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（后来发现是92胜率上王者，那我觉得可能是炸鱼）"}
{"time": 1768308985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782736801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（说用了20来个不同的英雄）"}
{"time": 1768308998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292556659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但其实没打过什么id局，基本都是路人）"}
{"time": 1768309016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119929508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（id就打过一次盗圣，还是counter盗圣来着）"}
{"time": 1768309028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247760265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(说是ai"}
{"time": 1768309077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103136402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=957668310]“嗯...”接过徽章，有些放松的感觉，“谢谢学长。”"}
{"time": 1768309136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077164800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=957668310]最后对方重新阅完你的卷，点了点头，同样推了一枚黄铜套壳给你“欢迎加入，伊恩同学。下周开始，每两周的周六上午10点会有一个定期会议，记得及时参加。”"}
{"time": 1768309167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159836366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好的，谢谢学长...接下来还需要做什么吗”"}
{"time": 1768309285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9204629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在没有了。下周五会有一次培训。等之后的通知就好。你想的话，也可以留在这里，看看学生会的办事流程”"}
{"time": 1768309344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1272101145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "朝伊恩点点头，退后几步推推莫奈"}
{"time": 1768309506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "186121236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "梅琳娜倒是没打算逗留，已经站到莫奈旁边了。看你也完事了，轻轻点点头，看起来好像成功入会对她来说并没有那么值得特殊对待"}
{"time": 1768309673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143992424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把东西收好，对着伊恩挥挥手，\"拜拜。\"随后对着身旁两位开口，\"莫奈想去哪个社团?\"一边迈步"}
{"time": 1768309705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1673271805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“学长再见，舒茉再见”然后去找亚克和夏洛克了“走吧，我们去其他地方逛逛，看看有没有什么你们感兴趣的社团”"}
{"time": 1768309944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811177847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1143992424]“嗯嗯……先去哪个好呐？”莫奈搓着手“陪我先去舞蹈社看看？我怕一会在烹饪社试吃太多跳不动了”"}
{"time": 1768310029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478393587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1673271805]“我倒是有，不过我现在非常，非常好奇，夏洛克同学到底对什么社团感兴趣？”亚克倒是没给提议，而是把问题丢给夏洛克"}
{"time": 1768310035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902799634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我为什么要把问题丢给我自己）"}
{"time": 1768310087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "994935019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也好好奇...夏洛克同学，你有心仪的选择了吗”看向他"}
{"time": 1768310200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748136755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=811177847]\"嗯嗯。\"使劲点头，有些好奇莫奈跳舞的样子，\"感觉莫奈什么都会呢...\""}
{"time": 1768310242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1977724472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=994935019]“心理学和新闻科，显而易见”他点头"}
{"time": 1768310264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747337748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1977724472]两个听起来就……比起社团更像选修课的词"}
{"time": 1768310547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123642836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样吗...仔细想一想确实是夏洛克的风格呢”"}
{"time": 1768310641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593229091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=748136755]“哪有，我只是……嗯，比较擅长展现自己？”她难得看起来表情比较认真“真说起来，你们会的东西肯定比我多的。”随后她很快换回之前轻松的风格脸垮下来“啊啊完蛋啦，今天过后就要被你们知根知底拿捏死了……拜托手下留情好不好？”"}
{"time": 1768310722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022850328", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2123642836]“那我们现在出发。”他的语气不带商量，并且难得地听起来有些，欢欣？实际上他已经三步并作两步地出发了"}
{"time": 1768310753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "700833044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（gametime去了）"}
{"time": 1768310791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701679689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=84C084E1CBC1099E6482722445239FFB.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQSIpzb4CeMZaVKUIuqbigdOhI3MhiUzQsg_woomZP0g8-IkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ7SvdSTPphufQXANI-egRunoC-1SCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMIZxq83kdkNsENjfXsXptPQvMhjCnZq9WhGD4mnEPWsiJXbToav8I-nwdCqjrIzUKA,file_size=190100]"}
{"time": 1768310837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925556109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=593229091]“哪有。”掩着嘴巴轻轻笑起来，“我怎么拿捏得住莫奈嘛，而且...我什么都不会...要学习的真的有很多。”说到最后语气有些低落。"}
