{"time": 1768328963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "66275987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1925556109]“那当然……我们是学生嘛。”莫奈不以为意，牵着你们来到舞蹈社前"}
