{"time": 1768447806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "477585241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1878225438]\"嗯...接下来有什么安排?我的话...还想去文学社看一看...\""}
{"time": 1768447993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1835212695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉看起来都蛮可爱的...舒茉在的话肯定会很喜欢吧，过去找只可爱的小狐狸摸一摸"}
{"time": 1768448094, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1898416531", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=9A045E7C40F286B1CABB01C623B04A3A.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSgcavOVtEnzoG7iLt60CbDpGZLrhicqA8g_woolKD4ws6MkgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQQHSXHT3EANcXk0spE5GUSHoCjnKCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMHDEeRlE6q3UKI6Ez-lOGanqoF_gXQFsp0FtqMLZimdeJwU4Q8-CnM9a-bfcbhysmg,file_size=250908]"}
