{"time": 1768534186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "776857325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=60858744]\"嗯...练习的时候可以教教我么...\"低着头看着地面，语气弱弱地"}
